{"id":"grenoble","name":"格勒诺布尔","en":"Grenoble","country":"France","lat":45.1869,"lng":5.7264,"dek":"三山夹两河，白色煤炭与砖瓦之城","history":"格勒诺布尔的城市前身是伊泽尔河与德拉克河交汇处的一座桥梁聚落，罗马人在此设卡驻军。公元四世纪末，皇帝格拉提安以自己的名字将此地命名为格拉提安城，城市由此得名。此后数百年间，这里先后被勃艮第人、法兰克人控制，逐渐成为多菲内地区的中心。\n\n十三世纪初，罗曼什河谷山体滑坡形成的堰塞湖溃决，洪水在深夜灌入城中，伤亡惨重，主教也在数月后去世。灾后重建漫长而缓慢，城市靠自由贸易宪章和免税特权重新吸引居民，城墙与主教座堂陆续修复，大学也在十四世纪创立。十四世纪中期，多菲内并入法兰西王国，格勒诺布尔成为行省首府，议会与高等法院相继设立。\n\n宗教战争中，这座城市被胡格诺派攻占，教堂被焚，此后不同教派在一位胡格诺将领的宽松治理下逐步调和。十八世纪末，多菲内三级会议在此召开，民众向士兵投掷砖瓦，史称砖瓦之日，被一些学者视为大革命的先声。十九世纪末，阿尔卑斯山区的水电开发让这座城市获得白色煤炭之都的称呼， twentieth 世纪又因冬季奥运会而经历一轮大规模城市建设。","culture":"格勒诺布尔的城市性格里有两条线索，一条是山，一条是水。沙特勒斯、贝勒多讷与韦科尔三面环绕，城市被压缩在河谷里，抬头即是岩壁；伊泽尔河与德拉克河在此交汇，十九世纪末的水电开发又把山上的落差变成了电力与产业。山与水的结合，让这里既是登山者的出发点，也是一座以科学与工程见长的城市。\n\n文化上，这里出过作家司汤达，莫里哀也曾在此居住数年。十八世纪的咖啡馆、剧院与图书馆先后出现，城市早早有了公共文化生活的雏形。二十世纪中期以后，核能研究、大学城与科研机构陆续落成，学生与研究者构成了街头的一层日常底色。老城中心的石板路、河畔的堤岸与山坡上的要塞，至今仍是这座城市最日常的背景。","pull":"山压着城，水推着城，砖瓦曾在此掷向士兵。","sights":[{"name":"巴士底山","orig":"La Bastille","intro":"俯瞰全城的古老要塞群，沿山脊分布着城墙与堡垒。可乘缆车上山，也可步行约四十分钟登顶。山顶能看到城市与三面山脉的全景，圣洛朗一侧的巨型阶梯适合上下穿行；途中还会经过一处废弃的旧研究所建筑，教室与阶梯教室仍可走进去。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Bastille_-_Grenoble_-_France.JPG/960px-Bastille_-_Grenoble_-_France.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bastille_(Grenoble)"},{"name":"保罗·米斯特拉尔公园","orig":"Parc Paul Mistral","intro":"市中心的大片绿地，有草坪、林荫道和溜冰场，常有人在此打街头冰球。公园中央立着为一九二五年国际水力博览会建造的佩雷塔，夜间打上蓝光，外形容易被联想成科幻片里的道具或小说中的高塔。塔因安全问题长期关闭，近年整修后重新开放。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Allee_parc_Paul-Mistral_-_Grenoble.JPG/960px-Allee_parc_Paul-Mistral_-_Grenoble.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paul_Mistral_Park"},{"name":"格勒诺布尔博物馆","orig":"Musée de Grenoble","intro":"靠近主教座堂的美术馆，建筑本身现代而简洁。馆藏包括佛罗伦萨画派作品，以及法国、佛兰德、荷兰与西班牙画派的大幅油画，现代艺术部分藏有毕加索、马蒂斯、米罗、康定斯基与沃霍尔的作品。乘电车到圣母院站即可到达，每月第一个周日免费。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Musee_Grenoble.JPG/960px-Musee_Grenoble.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Museum_of_Grenoble"},{"name":"格勒诺布尔主教座堂","orig":"Cathédrale Notre-Dame de Grenoble","intro":"伊泽尔河左岸的老城主教座堂，其前身可追溯到中世纪早期的圣母教堂。十三世纪末重建后，它成为城市宗教生活的中心，周边还留有圣安德肋堂等旧建筑。建筑历经火灾与宗教战争的破坏，如今的立面与内部格局混合了不同时期的痕迹，是老城步行时绕不开的一处。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Grenoble-Notre-Dame.jpg/960px-Grenoble-Notre-Dame.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A0%BC%E5%8B%92%E8%AF%BA%E5%B8%83%E5%B0%94%E4%B8%BB%E6%95%99%E5%BA%A7%E5%A0%82"},{"name":"圣洛朗建筑博物馆","orig":"Musée archéologique Saint-Laurent","intro":"伊泽尔河右岸的旧教堂，始建于中世纪早期，据传与七世纪的一位主教有关。建筑下方叠压着更早的宗教遗迹，如今作为建筑与考古博物馆开放。展线沿地下与地面空间展开，能看到不同时代的墙体与墓葬遗迹，是理解这座城市早期历史的一处安静所在。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Mus%C3%A9e_arch%C3%A9ologique1_-_Grenoble.JPG/960px-Mus%C3%A9e_arch%C3%A9ologique1_-_Grenoble.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"奶酪火锅","orig":"fondue","intro":"阿尔卑斯山区的冬季家常菜，把奶酪在锅里融化，用长叉叉面包蘸着吃。格勒诺布尔周边山区的餐馆冬季常备，市中心老城一带也能找到。吃时配白葡萄酒或茶，几个人围一锅，是山里最朴素的取暖方式。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Fondue_dish.jpg/960px-Fondue_dish.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%9D%E5%A3%AB%E7%81%AB%E9%8D%8B"},{"name":"拉克莱特","orig":"raclette","intro":"把整块奶酪烤软后刮到盘子里，配煮土豆、腌黄瓜和洋葱一起吃。这是萨瓦与多菲内一带的冬季吃法，格勒诺布尔的山地餐馆多有供应。奶酪融化时的气味很直接，适合冷天里慢慢吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/La_Clayette_-_vue_vers_le_centre_ville.jpg/960px-La_Clayette_-_vue_vers_le_centre_ville.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8B%89%E5%85%8B%E8%8E%B1%E7%89%B9"},{"name":"多菲内饺子","orig":"Ravioles du Dauphiné","intro":"多菲内地区的小方饺，馅料以奶酪为主，常做成焗烤。格勒诺布尔老城的传统餐馆里能点到，素食者也可以问清楚馅料再决定。做法朴素，奶酪味浓，是当地菜单上常见的一道。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Beaumes-de-Venise_Ravioles_en_gratin.jpg/960px-Beaumes-de-Venise_Ravioles_en_gratin.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"法式塔可","orig":"French tacos","intro":"格勒诺布尔自称是法式塔可的发源地，里昂人对此有不同意见。它和墨西哥塔可无关，更像把烤肉、薯条和酱料卷进面饼再压烤，街头烤肉店多有出售。分量足，适合赶路时吃一份。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/French_Tacos_from_O%27Tacos.jpg/960px-French_Tacos_from_O%27Tacos.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_tacos"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Grenoble_rope_way_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg/1280px-Grenoble_rope_way_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Grenoble_City.jpg/1280px-Grenoble_City.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[5.6776059,45.2128694],[5.6990123,45.1975676],[5.700664,45.1954134],[5.7016164,45.189269],[5.7002223,45.1601452],[5.7038437,45.1584628],[5.7194038,45.1590067],[5.7209027,45.1598241],[5.7304481,45.1590757],[5.7305171,45.1574103],[5.731653,45.1572883],[5.7317571,45.1547907],[5.7348186,45.155121],[5.7348578,45.1541442],[5.7377731,45.154207],[5.7370375,45.1580228],[5.7375482,45.1593099],[5.7397906,45.1598433],[5.7401026,45.1628003],[5.7413531,45.1640654],[5.7412418,45.1667985],[5.7430295,45.166375],[5.745416,45.1715271],[5.7473613,45.1697159],[5.7497863,45.1689146],[5.7504911,45.1696151],[5.7531315,45.1754765],[5.7503987,45.1807399],[5.7479165,45.1822348],[5.7463625,45.1863231],[5.749113,45.188869],[5.744982,45.189121],[5.742156,45.19091],[5.743175,45.197866],[5.740095,45.201503],[5.737301,45.202196],[5.734922,45.201257],[5.7259156,45.2051417],[5.7244858,45.2023998],[5.725562,45.1995487],[5.7250391,45.1988777],[5.7228432,45.1982731],[5.7179244,45.2000063],[5.7154067,45.1997808],[5.7108774,45.2045261],[5.6957281,45.2096998],[5.6840442,45.2118927],[5.6796304,45.2140762],[5.6776059,45.2128694]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"格勒诺布尔","en":"Grenoble","voyage":"Grenoble"}}}